("Requirement traceability worksheet", "The following worksheet structure can connect report claims to evidence. Keeping this trace helps future revisions avoid calling a planned behavior implemented.", ["Requirement ID and description.","Implementation location and observed source behavior.","Verification case, evidence artifact, result, and revision."], "A requirement without a test or source reference should remain an open item."),
("Non-functional constraints", "Several constraints follow from the architecture even though they are not fully implemented. Provider availability, network latency, browser DOM changes, and credential configuration all affect the user-visible result.", ["Generation depends on network access to the backend and Gemini service.","The extension depends on Gmail DOM structures that can change.","The local endpoint and fixed configuration are suitable only for development demonstration."], "Document each environment boundary before a public demonstration."),
