("UI layout and accessibility map", "The React interface presents a title, multiline input, tone selector, submit action, progress indicator, generated text, and copy action. The visual order should match keyboard and screen-reader reading order.", ["Give every form control a programmatic label.","Announce progress and errors without moving focus unexpectedly.","Support zoom, narrow viewports, keyboard use, and visible focus."], "The supplied initial-state screenshot documents appearance only and is not an accessibility test."),
